<h2 class="bold" id="sizes"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="spacing#sizes">Sizes</a></h2>
<p>Orange uses these default sizes for space distribution.</p>
<div class="mb-large"><div><table class="table table--compact mb-none"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Size</th><th scope="col">Visual</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>xsmall</td><td>5px</td><td><div class="mb-xsmall"></div></td></tr><tr><td>small</td><td>10px</td><td><div class="mb-small"></div></td></tr><tr><td>medium</td><td>20px</td><td><div class="mb-medium"></div></td></tr><tr><td>large</td><td>30px</td><td><div class="mb-large"></div></td></tr><tr><td>xlarge</td><td>60px</td><td><div class="mb-xlarge"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h2 class="bold" id="bottom-margin"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="spacing#bottom-margin">Bottom margin</a></h2>
<p>There is only one way to create additional space and that is by adding
